ne-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A Kids Race parte \u00e0s 08:45, a Corrida de 10 km \u00e0s 09:15, a Meia Maratona de 21,097 km \u00e0s 10:00 e a Caminhada de 4 km \u00e0s 10:30.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funcionam as vagas de partida na Meia Maratona?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A partida dos 21K \u00e9 organizada por blocos de ritmo: Elite e sub 4:00\/km a sub 5:00\/km \u00e0s 10:00, sub 5:30\/km a sub 6:00\/km \u00e0s 10:05 e +6:00\/km \u00e0s 10:10.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando \u00e9 feito o levantamento dos kits de participante?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O levantamento realiza-se na Decathlon Amadora de 26 a 28 de novembro de 2026 (n\u00e3o h\u00e1 entrega de dorsais no dia do evento).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O percurso \u00e9 favor\u00e1vel a recordes pessoais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, o tra\u00e7ado ao longo da marginal ribeirinha de Bel\u00e9m e do Tejo \u00e9 100% plano e r\u00e1pido, ideal para alcan\u00e7ar melhores marcas na dist\u00e2ncia.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Meia Maratona Descobrimentos 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-29\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Pra\u00e7a do Imp\u00e9rio \/ Museu da Marinha (Bel\u00e9m)\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Xistarca \/ Generali Tranquilidade \/ CM Lisboa\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a Meia Maratona dos Descobrimentos 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no domingo, 29 de novembro de 2026, com partida na Pra\u00e7a do Imp\u00e9rio e meta no Museu da Marinha, em Bel\u00e9m (Lisboa).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e hor\u00e1rios de partida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A Kids Race parte \u00e0s 08:45, a Corrida de 10 km \u00e0s 09:15, a Meia Maratona de 21,097 km \u00e0s 10:00 e a Caminhada de 4 km \u00e0s 10:30.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funcionam as vagas de partida na Meia Maratona?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A partida dos 21K \u00e9 organizada por blocos de ritmo: Elite e sub 4:00\/km a sub 5:00\/km \u00e0s 10:00, sub 5:30\/km a sub 6:00\/km \u00e0s 10:05 e +6:00\/km \u00e0s 10:10.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e quando \u00e9 feito o levantamento dos kits de participante?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O levantamento realiza-se na Decathlon Amadora de 26 a 28 de novembro de 2026 (n\u00e3o h\u00e1 entrega de dorsais no dia do evento).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O percurso \u00e9 favor\u00e1vel a recordes pessoais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, o tra\u00e7ado ao longo da marginal ribeirinha de Bel\u00e9m e do Tejo \u00e9 100% plano e r\u00e1pido, ideal para alcan\u00e7ar melhores marcas na dist\u00e2ncia.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":65935,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,672,28,41],"event_type_2":[33,727],"event_type_3":[744],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-48113","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-lisboa","event_organizer-xistarca","event_type-corrida","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-meiamaratona","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_3-sim"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/meia-maratona-descobrimentos-2026-1024x576.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/48113","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=48113"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\